# Niri

- Config root: `niri/` → deployed to `~/.config/niri` via `nixos/home/programs/niri/default.nix`.
- Keybindings: `niri/keymap.kdl` (imported from main config). Window rules: `niri/window-rule.kdl`, startup: `niri/startup.kdl`.
- System enables Niri in `nixos/modules/desktop-configuration.nix` (`programs.niri.enable`, xwayland, portals).
- KDL edits need a user-initiated rebuild (see `AGENTS.md`); agents must not run `nh os switch` / test unless asked.
